  "name": "starmap",
  "description": "A sophisticated repository indexing pipeline that leverages LLMs and high-dimensional embeddings to generate semantic summaries and discover conceptual alignments across heterogeneous codebases. It automates technical metadata extraction, authorship attribution via git history, and term clustering to build 'metaconstellations' of related projects. The system integrates a Rust-based extraction core with Python post-processing and local embedding infrastructure via vLLM or TEI.",
